  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Foce del Sele</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>\r\n<p>The sanctuary was constructed around the end of the sixth century BC. An earthquake destroyed the sanctuary in AD 63 and the AD 79 eruption of Vesuvius further obscured the site.</p>",
